  "description": "Cowboy Milky is a playful and eye-catching display font featuring a unique cow print pattern inside each letter. Inspired by farm life and western themes, this font brings a fun, cheerful, and rustic vibe to your designs. Perfect for kids projects, farm-themed designs, western branding, posters, merchandise, and creative crafts, Cowboy Milky adds a bold and charming personality to any typography layout.\nIts chunky letterforms and decorative cow spots make it highly suitable for headlines, logos, packaging, invitations, and sublimation designs that need a cute and standout look.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Cowboy Milky is a playful and eye-catching display font featuring a unique cow print pattern inside each letter. Inspired by farm life and western themes, this font brings a fun, cheerful, and rustic vibe to your designs. Perfect for kids projects, farm-themed designs, western branding, posters, merchandise, and creative crafts, Cowboy Milky adds a bold and charming personality to any typography layout.</p>\n<p>Its chunky letterforms and decorative cow spots make it highly suitable for headlines, logos, packaging, invitations, and sublimation designs that need a cute and standout look.</p>",
